v Stoler of Israel’s Calcalist, claiming that Intel (INTC) has lost its business with Apple (AAPL) for versions of the iPhone to come in 2020.", "external_links": ["https://www.tumblr.com/widgets/share/tool?posttype=link&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.barrons.com%2Farticles%2Fintel-says-its-wireless-plans-customers-are-on-track-1530831591%3Fmod%3Dyahoobarrons%26ru%3Dyahoo%26yptr%3Dyahoo%26soc_src%3Dsocial-sh%26soc_trk%3Dtu&content=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.barrons.com%2Farticles%2Fintel-says-its-wireless-plans-customers-are-on-track-1530831591%3Fmod%3Dyahoobarrons%26ru%3Dyahoo%26yptr%3Dyahoo%26soc_src%3Dsocial-sh%26soc_trk%3Dtu&caption=This%20evening%2C%C2%A0Intel%20(INTC)%20responded"], "published": "2018-07-06T02:01:00.000+03:00", "crawled": "2018-07-06T02:20:19.001+03:00", "highlightTitle": ""}